---
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import InterestCTA from "@/components/InterestCTA.astro";
import photo from "@/assets/hero/02-boy-with-chickens.jpeg";
---

<PageLayout
  title="Gather"
  eyebrow="Coming soon"
  lede="Learning, cooking and celebrating together on the farm."
  image={photo}
  imageAlt="A young child walking across the pasture toward the chickens and their coops"
>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      We want Thistledown to be somewhere people come to, not just somewhere food leaves from. Most of us are a long way
      from where our food is raised — we'd like to close that gap a little, one afternoon at a time.
    </p>
    <p>
      Nothing is booked yet. These are the kinds of things we're planning, and we'd love your help deciding where to
      start.
    </p>

    <h2>What we're planning</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Hands-on farm days.</strong> Move the flock to fresh grass, collect eggs and see how rotational grazing
        works up close.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Kitchen workshops.</strong> The skills behind our farm kitchen: rich bone broth, a proper pie crust,
        preserving the harvest.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Seasonal farm dinners.</strong> Long-table meals on the farm, cooked from what's in the fields and
        pastures that week.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Visits for groups.</strong> Time on the farm for families, schools and community groups who want to see
        where food comes from.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="cta">
    <InterestCTA
      title="Help us shape it"
      text="Tell us what you'd like to learn or take part in, and we'll let you know when the first dates are set."
      subject="Gather — keep me posted"
    />
  </div>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .cta { margin-top: var(--space-5); }
</style>
